# Convex CLI Environment Variables
# Copy this file to packages/backend/.env.local (optional - Convex CLI will create it automatically)

# ============================================
# Convex Deployment (Auto-generated)
# ============================================
# This variable tells the Convex CLI which deployment to use.
# It is automatically generated when you run `bun run dev` for the first time.
# Convex CLI will create this file and add the value here.
#
# Format: dev:your-deployment-name or prod:your-deployment-name
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=dev:your-deployment-name

# ============================================
# Note: Convex Function Environment Variables
# ============================================
# Variables used by Convex functions (running in Convex cloud) are set in the
# Convex Dashboard (Settings → Environment Variables), NOT in this file:
#
# - SITE_URL: Your app URL (required for Better Auth)
# - ENCRYPTION_SECRET: Secret for encrypting API keys (must match apps/web/.env.local)
# - CURSOR_WEBHOOK_URL: Optional webhook URL for agent status updates
# - CURSOR_WEBHOOK_SECRET: Optional webhook secret for signature verification
